  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 53 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^24 + x^26 + x^27 + x^29, b(x) = x^11 + x^21 + x^32 + x^42 in F_2[x]/(x^53 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^53 - 1)",
